{"dog":{"age_group":"young","application_url":"https://www.nycacc.org/adopt/adoption-process/","availability_detail":"available","breed_display":"Medium mixed breed","breed_primary":"Medium Mixed Breed Cross","description_text":"Since I'm a long stay pup, my adoption fee has been reduced! Visit me today to find out my favorite treats and how you can take me home!\n\nMy foster writes:\nLemon Poppyseed is an amazing pup and loves staring out our windows to admire the world around her. She is a huge fan of toys and has an adorable habit of occasionally bringing me one of her balls for a bit of fetch while I work at my desk. We are still practicing on meeting new people and working through distractions outside but inside the house she is a perfect foster loving snuggles and kisses on the couch and hanging out for evening tv time. She would do well in a quiet household and is an excellent work from home colleague! If you are looking for a low-key, couch mate or work from home buddy- this is the gal for you!\n\nWhat my friends at ACC say about me:\n\nI would appreciate slow introductions to new people and places to help me feel safe.\n\nI would do best in a home with only adult humans.\n\nI prefer to call the shots and enjoy coming to you when I'm ready for pets.","detail_url":"https://nycaccpets.shelterbuddy.com/animal/animalDetails.asp?s=adoption&searchTypeId=4&animalType=3%2C16&pagesize=75&task=view&tpage=12&searchType=4&animalid=202813","id":"547c904d0b0d5d7befb81d90c4ea2bb6","image_urls":["https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/31ae33144df74c46b00ecf5f27190180-1787247172-1789727013-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/fca9d3505d934f5d9e5ac0287e7837a9-1789320373-1789320373-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/6b071e8e2b7d4dd0bc3c881929a1bf2b-1789320373-1789320373-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/6bbcd82bf1994c3ebc8464066ba1e132-1787247166-1787247231-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelter